description:
TenantId is only logged as a discrete parameter in specific middleware messages. It is NOT globally enriched into every log event via LogContext.PushProperty.

Fix in TenantResolutionMiddleware, after resolving tenant:
```csharp
using (LogContext.PushProperty("TenantId", tenantId))
{
    await _next(context);
}
```

This ensures every log line emitted during the request lifecycle includes TenantId as a structured property, enabling filtering in Loki/Grafana.

For Wolverine messages: do the same in TenantRestoringMiddleware after restoring tenant context.

