Storage module uses S3 as a critical dependency but has no health check.

Fix: Implement IHealthCheck in Storage module that verifies S3 connectivity:
```csharp
public sealed class StorageHealthCheck(IAmazonS3 s3Client) : IHealthCheck
{
    public async Task<HealthCheckResult> CheckHealthAsync(
        HealthCheckContext context, CancellationToken ct)
    {
        await s3Client.ListBucketsAsync(ct);
        return HealthCheckResult.Healthy();
    }
}
```

